Package: AgentLib
Title: Multi-Agent System Framework for R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Alexander", "Alexeyuk", , "a1exander.alexeyuk@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive framework for building and managing multi-agent systems in R. 
    Provides tools for creating intelligent agents with customizable behaviors, 
    communication protocols, and coordination mechanisms. Supports various agent 
    architectures including reactive, deliberative, and hybrid models. Features 
    include agent lifecycle management, message passing, environment simulation, 
    and distributed computing capabilities for complex multi-agent scenarios.
